<title>USA: CEZ a.s. unit sells $200 mln notes.</title>
<headline>CEZ a.s. unit sells $200 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>CEZ Finance BV, a unit of CEZ a.s., was priced Thursday,</p>
<p>according to lead manager JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CEZ FINANCE BV</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.960  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.131 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +95 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
